# New symmetric object property triples added for the ontology.
# These properties are introduced to ensure that for each relevant object property,
# its inverse-symmetric counterpart is explicitly represented where appropriate.

@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

owl:symmetricProperty a owl:ObjectProperty .